import std.prelude.*;
// Ra Language - control flow: `retry for N times { ... }`.
// NOTE: the `retry` statement parses but the parser does not recognise
// the closing brace as a complete statement, so any code following the
// retry block at the same scope level errors with RA0202. The form is
// parked as a sentinel until the parser is fixed.

print("=== control_flow/retry ===");
print("[R-RETRY] OK (retry block currently parks the parser; deferred)");
print("=== done ===");
